        "CopyrightInformation": "2016 BMJ Publishing Group Ltd.",
        "AbstractText": "Tracheal leiomyoma is a rare benign tumour with less than a 100 cases reported in the literature. We report a case of leiomyoma initially presenting and being treated as asthma until it lead to life-threatening tracheal obstruction, requiring immediate surgical intervention."
